{"id":"s3.5.2","slug":"fun-with-factorials-fractions","title":"a! ± b! / c!","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">These problems involve simplifying fractions with factorials. The key is usually to factor out the smallest factorial in the expression.</p><p class=\"mb-4\">For example, $\\frac{8! + 6!}{7!} = \\frac{8 \\times 7! + 6!}{7!} = 8 + \\frac{6!}{7!} = 8 + \\frac{1}{7} = 8\\frac{1}{7}$.</p><p class=\"mb-4\">Another example: $\\frac{3! + 4! - 5!}{3!} = \\frac{3!(1 + 4 - (5 \\times 4))}{3!} = 1 + 4 - 20 = -15$.</p>","summary":"These problems involve simplifying fractions with factorials.","generation_guideline":"Generate a problem involving a fraction with factorials in the numerator and/or denominator.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{8! + 6!}{7!}$. (mixed number)","answer":"8 1/7","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":2,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{10! + 8!}{9!}$. (mixed number)","answer":"10 1/9","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":3,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{7! - 5!}{6!}$. (mixed number)","answer":"6 5/6","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":4,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{11! - 9!}{10!}$. (mixed number)","answer":"10 9/10","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":5,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{10! - 11!}{9!}$.","answer":"-100","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":6,"text":"Calculate $6 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 4! - 5!$.","answer":"600","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":7,"text":"Calculate $(2! + 3!) \\div 5!$.","answer":"1/15","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":8,"text":"Calculate $(2! \\times 3!) - 4!$.","answer":"-12","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":9,"text":"Calculate $7! \\div 6! - 5!$.","answer":"-113","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":10,"text":"Calculate $7 \\times 5! - 6!$.","answer":"120","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":11,"text":"Calculate $2! - 3! \\times 5!$.","answer":"-718","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":12,"text":"Calculate $8! \\div 6! - 4!$.","answer":"32","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":13,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{5! \\cdot 4!}{6!}$.","answer":"4","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":14,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{4 \\times 5! - 5 \\times 4!}{4!}$.","answer":"15","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","fractions"]},{"id":15,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{4 \\times 5! + 5 \\times 4!}{4!}$.","answer":"25","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","fractions"]},{"id":16,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{6 \\times 7! - 7 \\times 6!}{6!}$.","answer":"35","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","fractions"]},{"id":17,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{10 \\times 9! - 10! \\times 9}{9!}$.","answer":"-80","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","fractions"]},{"id":18,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{8! \\times 7 - 8 \\times 7!}{7!}$.","answer":"48","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","fractions"]},{"id":19,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{11 \\times 10! - 11! \\times 10}{11!}$.","answer":"-9","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","fractions"]},{"id":20,"text":"Calculate $6! \\div (3! \\times 2!)$.","answer":"60","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]}]}